          "name": "Target",
          "type": "UInterfaceProperty*"
        },
        {
          "name": "New Interface Class",
          "type": "UClass*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Setter function for this property's InterfaceClass member. Favor this\nfunction whilst loading (since, to handle circular dependencies, we defer\nsome class loads and use a placeholder class instead). It properly\nhandles deferred loading placeholder classes (so they can properly be\nreplaced later).\n@param  NewInterfaceClass    The InterfaceClass you want this property set with."
    }
